# Environment variables
.env

# Generated data & model artifacts (regenerate via the two commands in README.md)
#
# NOTE FOR DEPLOYMENT: these are excluded from the repo, which means a build
# made straight from git will NOT contain them, and every endpoint that needs
# one will fail at runtime. If you deploy this service, either commit the
# artifacts explicitly (git add -f) or generate them in a build step.
# GET /health/artifacts reports which are present on a running deployment.
app/data/*.csv
app/ml/*.pkl
app/ml/*.json
app/ml/*.npy

